OL,3,GNEWSAOver 800 Dorking Hospital no-shows
OL,4,Ain one month
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 800 missed appointments and
OL,7,Fshort notice cancellations have been
OL,8,Frecorded at a Surrey hospital in one
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FDorking Hospital saw 501 missed
OL,12,Fappointments and 312 cancelled by
OL,13,Fpatients with less than 24 hours'
OL,14,Fnotice in September, BBC Surrey has
OL,15,Flearned.
OL,17,FIn 2025-26, 1,620 first appointments
OL,18,Fwere not attended at the hospital,
OL,19,Faccording to NHS outpatient data.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
