OL,3,GNEWSAOver 800 Dorking Hospital no-shows
OL,4,Ain one month
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Stewart Tomlinson, medical director
OL,7,Fat Dorking Healthcare, said: "We can
OL,8,Festimate it's about #160 per missed
OL,9,Fappointment. Thinking about Dorking,
OL,10,Fevery month that's approximating
OL,11,F#120,000 - over a #1m a year in lost
OL,12,FNHS funding."
